cd agents\mcp_ha_server

# Run unit tests
pytest tests\

# Run with coverage
pytest --cov=src tests\

# Type checking
mypy src\
```

### Integration Setup Testing

```python
# Test config flow
pytest tests/test_config_flow.py -v

# Test entity creation
pytest tests/test_sensor.py -v

# Test coordinator updates
pytest tests/test_coordinator.py -v
```

### Manual Integration Testing

1. **Install in HA dev environment**

   ```powershell
   # Copy to custom_components
   scp -r integrations\my_integration david@192.168.1.110:/home/david/
   ssh david@192.168.1.110
   sudo cp -r /home/david/my_integration /opt/homeassistant/config/custom_components/
   docker restart homeassistant
   ```

2. **Monitor logs**

   ```bash
   # On remote HA
   docker logs -f homeassistant | grep my_integration
   ```

3. **Verify in UI**
